ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/dc121b1008343a5a62bd5bebf02fe94c.poster.avif?t=1756573246\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/dc121b1008343a5a62bd5bebf02fe94c.webm?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/dc121b1008343a5a62bd5bebf02fe94c.mp4?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/975a399e3806c0443a25eb852310fefa.avif?t=1756573246\" width=979 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new locations, unlock additional terminals, and upgrade your tugs and trailers to carry more baggage at once. As the airport grows, so do the challenges—scale smartly to keep up with demand and dominate the logistics game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/8c403c9a9529425066a444cb42be35a2.poster.avif?t=1756573246\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/8c403c9a9529425066a444cb42be35a2.webm?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/8c403c9a9529425066a444cb42be35a2.mp4?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/654c9bce49cd6d48909d97be62cc689b.avif?t=1756573246\" width=980 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place scanners to detect dangerous items or use a handheld detector to inspect bags yourself. Get it right and earn a bonus — make a mistake and face a penalty. Stay alert, because every decision matters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/b5baca94d0dfc14da2ce8cc1f1925b04.poster.avif?t=1756573246\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/b5baca94d0dfc14da2ce8cc1f1925b04.webm?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/b5baca94d0dfc14da2ce8cc1f1925b04.mp4?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/6f7f03de594f3c574665fca33b542db4.avif?t=1756573246\" width=979 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire workers and improve their skills to ensure your baggage department operates efficiently and without interruptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/c3dd756a1f24e653732cffb4e681543a.poster.avif?t=1756573246\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/c3dd756a1f24e653732cffb4e681543a.webm?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/c3dd756a1f24e653732cffb4e681543a.mp4?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/24eb6853db85c9d534a33b914f847e90.avif?t=1756573246\" width=979 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy licenses to unlock exclusive airline contracts and boost your baggage department’s income. Partner with various airlines to increase flight handling capacity and expand your operations. The stronger your collaborations, the greater your profits and growth opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/cb17864ccea28380bba3220f65c0759f.poster.avif?t=1756573246\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/cb17864ccea28380bba3220f65c0759f.webm?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/cb17864ccea28380bba3220f65c0759f.mp4?t=1756573246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/ad52dfe7806014690ac2336de7dee76b.avif?t=1756573246\" width=980 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your profits in the crypto market to grow your funds beyond the airport. Monitor price trends, buy low and sell high, and maximize your earnings. Smart investments can give your baggage department the financial boost it needs to expand and upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/4988129dc97792963120cb82b78aa2df.poster.avif?t=1756573246\" width=780 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647090/extras/4988129dc97792963120cb82b78a